"Automatic sync" = "自动同步";
"Preprocessing" = "预处理";
"Not provided" = "未提供";
"Missing provenance. Preserved for inspection, not used for matching." = "缺少来源信息。保留以供查看，不参与声纹匹配。";
"Sending library changes" = "正在发送资料变更";
"Receiving and applying resources" = "正在接收并应用资源";
"Verified bytes and model processing have separate completion states." = "资源校验完成与模型处理完成是不同的状态。";
"Synchronization timed out. Reconnect to retry." = "同步超时。请重新连接以重试。";
"Authorize only this trusted device. Both devices must enable sync. Connection, synchronization and model processing have separate states." = "仅授权此受信任设备。两端都必须启用同步。连接、数据同步和模型处理是不同的状态。";
"Sync with this device" = "与此设备同步";
"Enabling sync exchanges existing and future supported library changes over the authenticated local connection. Disabling pauses future transfer; it does not erase either library." = "启用后会通过已认证的本地连接交换已有及今后受支持的资料变更。关闭会暂停后续传输，不会清除任一端的资料。";
"Authorize voiceprints" = "授权声纹";
"Pause voiceprints" = "暂停声纹";
"Revoke voiceprints" = "撤销声纹授权";
"Pausing or revoking prevents future biometric transfer. Copies already received may remain on either device; this is not a remote erasure request." = "暂停或撤销后不再传输生物特征资料。已收到的副本可能仍保留在两端；这不是远程清除请求。";
"Retry" = "重试";
"Authorize voiceprints for this device?" = "向此设备授权声纹？";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"Speaker identities, names, meeting associations and actual voiceprint artifacts are sensitive biometric data. Allow this paired device to send and receive them locally. No cloud upload is authorized." = "说话人身份、名称、会议关联及实际声纹资源属于敏感生物特征资料。允许此已配对设备在本地发送和接收这些资料，不授权上传云端。";
"Voiceprints not authorized" = "声纹未授权";
"Voiceprints authorized" = "声纹已授权";
"Voiceprints paused" = "声纹已暂停";
"Voiceprints revoked" = "声纹授权已撤销";
"Transcript discovers your Mac on the local network. Confirm pairing on both devices, then authorize supported synchronization separately." = "Transcript 通过本地网络发现 Mac。请在两端确认配对，再单独授权受支持的同步功能。";
"Connection, synchronization and processing are separate. Review this device's permissions below." = "连接、数据同步和模型处理是不同的状态。请在下方查看此设备的授权。";
"Legacy immutable copies include audio and transcript text, not voiceprints or later edits. Automatic synchronization uses a separately authorized, versioned protocol." = "旧版不可变副本仅包含音频和转写文本，不包含声纹或后续编辑。自动同步使用单独授权的新版本协议。";
"Legacy immutable copies" = "旧版不可变副本";
